{"server":"tw","storyId":"act41side_level_act41side_05_beg","groupId":"act41side","stageId":"act41side_05","title":"溺火","storyCode":"EA-5","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act41side/level_act41side_05_beg.txt","sourceHash":"914fa6b079a4c8135595096800c114dc0d8dd30adb10a8e66ba70ae71b71f483","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"拉芙希妮得到“放逐王”的幫助，穿越了黑林的封鎖，與先前分開的友人們重逢。遺跡中，守靈人拒絕了拉芙希妮的未盡之言，但接受了為逝者舉辦葬禮的請求。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"59_g8_blackforest_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……先前遇到的那個，難道又是捉弄人的幻影？路是錯的，我好像又走回來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也看不清楚天色，不知道走了多久……還有多遠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我沒像布莉吉說的那樣，被黑霧和噪音擋在黑林之外，至少我進來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還是這些愛捉弄人的精怪、會指錯路給你的幻影、故意牽來枝條絆倒人的羽獸……倒是和我帶莫蘭他們回來時差不多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也許是這些樹木長得太高，也太茂密。它們遮住了天空，讓這裡面的生命與外界不同。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"59_g9_blackforest_inside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……沒走錯路，這裡就是黑林的中心了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"總感覺……這裡的景色也和我來的時候不一樣……那些代表秋天的金紅色呢？為什麼都消失了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼裡面變成現在這樣？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是黑霧？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也就是說，黑林最終還是拒絕我了，是嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"拉芙希妮緊緊握住手中的武器。假如真的如涅梅絲所說，深池離開城市之後就再也沒有回來，被黑霧吞噬的確是他們最有可能的下場。\n但黑霧並無攻擊她的跡象，只是停在原地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它是在……拒絕我嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，與其說是拒絕，倒不如說是冷漠……失望？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"除了植物婆娑的晃動之外，沒有任何能被當成回答的聲響。\n拉芙希妮搖搖頭，謹慎地經過黑霧身側，選擇了盡頭看起來有光亮的一條路，而黑霧仍然對她的通過無動於衷。\n那些樂於把人帶上歧途的精怪，此刻也不見蹤影。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"59_g9_blackforest_inside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不行，又是死路……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒時間在這裡逗留了。抱歉，我得燒出一條路——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那你真的是想太多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"誰？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“放逐王”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你覺得呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼會是……你？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在城裡的那位……先生。上次我就有問題要問你，但你卻——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“放逐王”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"上次見面確實算得上是不歡而散，不告而別。後面我也跟了你一路，看了你一路，就當是反思了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“放逐王”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"總之，我得承認你和我想的不太一樣，但現在還不是閒聊的時候。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“放逐王”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別燒那些樹木，只用你的火照亮它們就行了，看看它們到底是什麼東西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“是什麼東西”……？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"葉片鋒利，荊棘堅硬，枝條上甚至反射出金屬的冷光？這究竟是？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“放逐王”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是什麼不重要，你的火不可能燒掉這些東西，這才是重點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“放逐王”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"跟我來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“放逐王”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在黑霧改變主意之前，跟我來！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“放逐王”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我再晚一點跟你搭話，那個東西的心情稍微變差，你就會被直接吞了，骨頭屑也不剩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但那邊不是死路嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“放逐王”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼覺得眼見的東西就一定為實呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“放逐王”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聽我的，走！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"59_g7_blackforest_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是……我來納斯爾紗時走的那條路！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"剛剛那些小路竟然通向這裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先生，雖然冒昧，但您和林中的精怪……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“放逐王”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別傻了，我怎麼會和它們扯上關係。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“放逐王”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"倒是這片樹林，幾百年過去了，除了多了一層黑霧以外，裡面竟然還是這副樣子……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“放逐王”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵，煞風景。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再往前幾步就算是離開黑林了，不知道您能否——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“放逐王”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖嘖嘖，這還真是……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"發生什麼事了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“放逐王”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看你身後。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫蘭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"葦草！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔拉流民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"葦草，我們來了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"流民們的身影出現在黑林明亮的邊緣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫蘭","speakerId":"avg_npc_728_1","isRemote":false,"text":"城裡是不是出了什麼事？自從你進城之後，黑霧就像是突然發怒了一樣，將城市和外界嚴密地隔開，黑林這邊已經好幾天沒有人出入了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫蘭","speakerId":"avg_npc_728_1","isRemote":false,"text":"剛才有人去黑林外圍打獵，聽見林中有響動，有人聲，還有火光什麼的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫蘭","speakerId":"avg_npc_728_1","isRemote":false,"text":"之前也出過類似的事，守靈人讓我們不要靠近黑林，小心惹禍上身。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫蘭","speakerId":"avg_npc_728_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但這一次我們都認出來了，那是你的火。我們必須得過來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡太危險了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫蘭","speakerId":"avg_npc_728_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那也不該放任你一個人去承擔所有的危險。倫蒂尼姆郊外那次，我們在沼澤地等你的時候，大家就已經明白了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫蘭","speakerId":"avg_npc_728_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們信任你，你也該信任我們。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我很感激。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫蘭","speakerId":"avg_npc_728_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這不算什麼。我們先回聚落吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先生，不知道您——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫蘭","speakerId":"avg_npc_728_1","isRemote":false,"text":"葦草，怎麼了？你在對誰說話？還有人跟著你從黑林裡出來嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"紅龍轉身看去，那個不請自來的男人就像是陽光下的露珠一樣不見蹤影。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"59_g5_remains_outside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"感謝你們為這些人提供了住所，守靈人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴肅的守靈人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"涅梅絲將他們託付給我們，這就是我們應該做的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴肅的守靈人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，拉芙希妮小姐，守靈人承諾不將您的存在洩露給任何不知情的人。既然您已經確認了這些人的安危，我們可以就此分開了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫蘭","speakerId":"avg_npc_728_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是什麼意思？難道你們不歡迎她？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴肅的守靈人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"莫蘭，你們也一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴肅的守靈人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"兩條紅龍之間總會產生無盡的紛爭。如果你們擅自介入兩條紅龍之間的爭鬥，那我們也無力再為你們提供庇護。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔拉流民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"你們怎麼這樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴肅的守靈人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們一向如此。守靈人既不挑起衝突，也不試圖消弭衝突。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴肅的守靈人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"生者的爭端非我們所能干涉，我們只守望逝者的靈魂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴肅的守靈人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"紅龍，如果您真的如莫蘭等人所說，是一位悲憫而高尚的領導者，那您就更不該將這些無辜的人捲入您的鬥爭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這不是兩條紅龍之間的爭鬥，我是為了納斯爾紗的居民來向你們求助——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴肅的守靈人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鬥爭總有理由。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫蘭","speakerId":"avg_npc_728_1","isRemote":false,"text":"葦草不是一個會找藉口的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴肅的守靈人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"即便不是藉口，生者的糾紛也與我們無關……這是我們至今仍在為之品嚐苦果的教訓。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴肅的守靈人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請回吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算我來請你們安葬一位逝者……也不行嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴肅的守靈人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"安葬逝者？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴肅的守靈人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果的確如此，守靈人的營地會向您敞開，但也僅限葬禮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴肅的守靈人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"煩請告訴我逝者的姓名、事蹟，還有……請把他的亡骸交給我們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他叫……庫林，城裡的鐵匠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴肅的守靈人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"庫林？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴肅的守靈人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他的死因是什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他被紫色的死火奪取了生命與意志，即便是我的火焰……也無法再拯救他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴肅的守靈人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴肅的守靈人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那為什麼從所謂獨立到現在，沒有一個納斯爾紗人來找我們，讓我們幫城內的逝者舉行一場符合傳統的葬禮呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴肅的守靈人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原來……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴肅的守靈人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"戰爭結束後，第一個得到哀悼的納斯爾紗人……甚至沒有死在那場戰爭中。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"59_g10_indoor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"像這樣……把乾草紮成環？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫蘭","speakerId":"avg_npc_728_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒錯，然後把這些花卉裝飾在上面，編成花環就行了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫蘭","speakerId":"avg_npc_728_1","isRemote":false,"text":"記得我們在路上也有這麼一次，農民們把花環戴在你的頭上，祈求來年風調雨順。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔拉流民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"真懷念啊，感覺又回到那個時候了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在這裡住得不開心？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫蘭","speakerId":"avg_npc_728_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我自己倒是很自在，但其他人可能多少會覺得有些拘束吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔拉流民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"因為守靈人的生活就像在和自己過不去嘛。莫蘭，你那個詞是怎麼說的？“苦修”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔拉流民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"不喝酒，不開宴會，不吃過分烹飪的東西，甚至不會大聲說笑。每天從天不亮起床開始，直到半夜睡下，無論做什麼都有儀式。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔拉流民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然他們不用這一套來要求我們，但我們畢竟也得幫人家做些農活什麼的，還是要打交道的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔拉流民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"這幾天住下來，我都覺得自己快要不會笑了，哈哈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔拉流民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"只有莫蘭每天都會去找守靈人說話，每天都能學一點東西回來。今天是繩結的編法，明天是如何估算樹木壽命之類的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫蘭","speakerId":"avg_npc_728_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這倒是沒錯，不過和那些故事中的守靈人相比……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴肅的守靈人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"紅龍閣下？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"守靈人女士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴肅的守靈人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒想到您會在這裡與他們一同勞作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔拉流民","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"葦草一直都是這樣啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴肅的守靈人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫蘭","speakerId":"avg_npc_728_1","isRemote":false,"text":"需要我們迴避嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴肅的守靈人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我只是為了儀式需要，來確認死者的生平。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴肅的守靈人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請告訴我，紅龍，這段時間裡，庫林身上究竟發生什麼事情了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我會一五一十地把我見到的一切告訴你，守靈人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"希望這些事能對你有所觸動。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
